{
  "bookId": "hero-212111",
  "id": "bond-43807",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43807001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "《高等数学》、《线性代数》、《微积分》……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807003",
              "text": "怎么了？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43807003",
              "text": "为什么突然念起教科书来了？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "这些典籍……就是这个世界的「算经」吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807005",
              "text": "算是吧，你对它们感兴趣？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "并不，只是过去为了帮华焱管账，学过些皮毛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "数日之后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "还有吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807009",
              "text": "还有什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "之前书架上的那些典籍已经通读过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "还有更精深的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807012",
              "text": "数学分析？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43807012",
              "text": "……量子力学?"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "明白了，我会去借阅的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一周之后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "这两份卷子已经答完了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807016",
              "text": "（替龙缨批改。）"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "阅卷的结果出来了，虽然字迹显得复古，但答案毫无疑问是满分。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "为何你的手在颤抖？需要我用火给你暖暖身子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807019",
              "text": "很好，我已经没什么可以教的了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43807019",
              "text": "今天起，你就是我的数学老师。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "谬赞了，只是些粗浅的化用。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43807021",
              "text": "原来龙缨这么喜欢数学？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43807020",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "不知为何，与这些数字打交道，心境便会变得安宁。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43807022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "况且，还有你一直陪在我身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
